t-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#333333;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"15\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group21/M0A/11/5B/wKgJKFpfWsijBIygAEHRM5om48o373.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group21/M0A/11/5B/wKgJKFpfWsijBIygAEHRM5om48o373.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group21/M0A/11/5B/wKgJKFpfWsijBIygAEHRM5om48o373.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"500\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group21/M0A/11/5B/wKgJKFpfWsijBIygAEHRM5om48o373.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"93\"></p><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#333333;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;\" lang=\"en\">到此，我们在冰岛的所有旅行全部结束，第二天便坐飞机去了巴塞罗那，在那里逗留了3天再回国，其实对冰岛真的有点依依不舍，感觉7天并不够，这里也很推荐各位小伙伴，如果有机会的话，一定要去一次冰岛！</p><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#333333;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;\" lang=\"en\">这次冰岛之旅的音频也到此结束了，谢谢大家收听，下次我会分享我在土耳其的旅游经历，欢迎大家再次收听！</p>",
